c Board has a resin-coated writing surface available in white and green options. It is suitable for standard magnetic accessories.\\n\\nThe aluminium frame uses Electroplated Chrome Corners, and the smooth surface suits daily classroom or office writing. Balanced construction keeps it dependable for regular use.\\n\\nStandard sizes on this page are 3 x 4 ft, 4 x 4 ft, 5 x 4 ft, 6 x 4 ft, 8 x 4 ft. Larger or non-standard sizes are made to order — send the size you need and the team will quote it.\\n\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\",\"features\":[\"Surface — Resin coated writing surface in white and green options\",\"Magnetic use — Suitable for standard magnetic accessories\",\"Design — Aluminium frame with Electroplated Chrome Corners\",\"Finish — Smooth surface for daily classroom or office writing\",\"Build — Balanced construction for regular use\"],\"customisation\":null,\"media\":[\"$22:0:props:children:props:children:1:props:children:1:props:children:props:children:props:asset\"],\"videoId\":null,\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"deluxe-standard-magnetic-board--3-x-4-ft\",\"productId\":\"deluxe-standard-magnetic-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-DS-WHI-3X4FT0\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"3-x-4-ft\",\"label\":\"3 x 4 ft\",\"widthCm\":122,\"heightCm\":91},\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"priceInr\":2580,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock\":null,\"trackInventory\":false,\"available\":true,\"leadTimeDays\":null},{\"id\":\"deluxe-standard-magnetic-board--4-x-4-ft\",\"productId\":\"deluxe-standard-magnetic-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-DS-WHI-4X4FT0\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"4-x-4-ft\",\"label\":\"4 x 4 ft\",\"widthCm\":122,\"heightCm\":122},\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"priceInr\":3240,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock\":null,\"trackInventory\":false,\"available\":true,\"leadTimeDays\":null},{\"id\":\"deluxe-standard-magnetic-board--5-x-4-ft\",\"produc