 specification with Plusmark before dispatch.\",\"description\":\"The Metallic Premium Magnetic Board has a resin-coated writing surface suitable for marker (white) and chalk (green) boards. It accepts magnetic accessories such as magnets, charts and holders.\\n\\nHeavy-duty aluminium framing with Signature Dual-Tone Corners holds a smooth writing surface for regular writing and erasing. For heavy chalk usage without a magnetic requirement, Plusmark recommends the non-magnetic premium or ceramic boards for longer surface life.\\n\\nStandard sizes on this page are 3 x 4 ft, 4 x 4 ft, 5 x 4 ft, 6 x 4 ft, 8 x 4 ft. Larger or non-standard sizes are made to order — send the size you need and the team will quote it.\\n\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\",\"features\":[\"Surface — Resin coated writing surface suitable for marker (white) and chalk (green) boards\",\"Magnetic use — Compatible with magnets, charts and holders\",\"Design — Heavy-duty aluminium framing with Signature Dual-Tone Corners\",\"Finish — Smooth writing surface for regular writing and erasing\"],\"customisation\":null,\"media\":[{\"publicId\":\"plusmark/products/metallic-premium-magnetic-board\",\"alt\":\"Metallic Premium Magnetic Board - Metallic Premium Whiteboard by Plusmark\",\"width\":1400,\"height\":1400,\"source\":\"product\"}],\"videoId\":null,\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"metallic-premium-magnetic-board--3-x-4-ft\",\"productId\":\"metallic-premium-magnetic-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-MP-WHI-3X4FT0\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"3-x-4-ft\",\"label\":\"3 x 4 ft\",\"widthCm\":122,\"heightCm\":91},\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"priceInr\":4020,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock\":null,\"trackInventory\":false,\"available\":true,\"leadTimeDays\":null},{\"id\":\"metallic-premium-magnetic-board--4-x-4-ft\",\"productId\":\"metallic-premium-magnetic-board\",\